{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18511","headline":"和太原郑中丞登龙兴寺阁 · 欧阳詹","name":"和太原郑中丞登龙兴寺阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青窗朱户半天开，极目凝神望几回。\n晋国颓墉生草树，皇家瑞气在楼台。\n千条水入黄河去，万点山从紫塞来。\n独恨侍游违长者，不知高意是谁陪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18511.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18511","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}